 15pmMonday\, September 1 - 3:45pm Open Caption screenings:Sunday\, August 
 31 - 12:00pm\, 3:00pm\, 9:30pmTuesday\, September 2 - 3:45pm\, 7:00pm\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/jaws
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
